<title>NORWAY: Saga takes NOK 1 bln cost due to dollar.</title>
<headline>Saga takes NOK 1 bln cost due to dollar.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saga Petroleum ASA said on Thursday it had taken a charge of 1.024 billion crowns in the first four months of the year due to a strong dollar exchange rate.</p>
<p>The cost was linked to the company's dollar loan.</p>
<p>In the first four months of 1997 the dollar has risen to 7.11 crowns compared with 6.44 crowns, Saga said in a statement announcing the results.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
